    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200301/2022003010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか\r\n今日レッスンもう終わったんだもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022003010210,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "は、はい……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200301/2022003010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022003010220,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ご、ごめんなさい\r\nプロデューサーさん",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200301/2022003010220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ\r\nどうして小糸が謝るんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022003010230,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "だって\r\nせ、せっかく誘って貰って……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200301/2022003010230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022003010240,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "それに、プロデューサーさん\r\nどんなお店なのか気になるって言ってたのに……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200301/2022003010240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、なんだそんなことか！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022003010250,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "え……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200301/2022003010250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "また今度来ればいいじゃないか\r\n事務所から遠いわけでもないし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "小糸が来たければ\r\nいつだって、何回だって来れるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022003010260,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200301/2022003010260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日は急に声かけちゃったしな\r\n次に来た時の楽しみに取っておこう！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022003010270,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさん……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200301/2022003010270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それで、\r\n小糸はどれが食べたかったんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022003010280,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "え……！\r\nえっとですね、わたしは……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200301/2022003010280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022003010290,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "この、青いクリームソーダが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200301/2022003010290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお、いいな！\r\nそれだけでいいのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022003010300,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "え、ええ……！\r\n他にもですか……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200301/2022003010300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、すごく熱心に見てたから\r\n他にもあるんじゃないかと思って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022003010310,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "う…………\r\nこ、この、まあるいホットケーキも……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200301/2022003010310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど、やっぱり小糸は\r\n甘いものに目を付けてたんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022003010320,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "は、はい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200301/2022003010320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022003010330,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "ぷ、プロデューサーさんは\r\nどれがいいんですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200301/2022003010330"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？\r\nそうだな、うーん……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こういう店って、\r\nナポリタンとかが美味そうな気がするんだよなぁ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022003010340,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……！\r\nそ、そうなんですか……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200301/2022003010340"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022003010350,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "それなら、それも食べないと……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200301/2022003010350"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、他にも美味そうなものが多いし\r\n全部テーブルに並べきれるかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022003010360,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200301/2022003010360"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022003010370,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "わ、わたしそんなにいっぺんに\r\nたくさん食べられませんよ……！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200301/2022003010370"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それならやっぱり\r\n何回でも来ないとだな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
